flowchart TB
    Browser["Your Browser<br/>Performance Studio Web App<br/>React · Vite"]
    RH["Request Handler<br/>Processes all user actions"]

    subgraph Server["Performance Studio Server"]
        RH
        AI["AI Engine<br/>Generates test scripts"]
        EA["Email Alerts<br/>Sends reports after each run"]
        VC["Version Control<br/>Tracks scripts via Git"]
        TE["Test Executor<br/>Runs JMeter and K6"]
        AH["Auto-Healer<br/>Fixes scripts after a failed run"]
    end

    subgraph ExtSvc["External Services"]
        AIP["AI Provider<br/>OpenAI GPT-4o or<br/>Anthropic Claude"]
        ES["Email Server<br/>Gmail · Outlook · SMTP"]
        GP["Git Platform<br/>GitHub · GitLab · Bitbucket"]
    end

    subgraph ExecEnv["Test Execution Environment"]
        TC["Test Container<br/>JMeter · K6 · Java · Node.js"]
    end

    subgraph Storage["Data Storage"]
        DB[("Database<br/>PostgreSQL")]
        FS["File Storage<br/>Scripts · Test data · Reports"]
    end

    Browser -->|User actions| RH
    RH --> AI
    RH --> EA
    RH --> VC
    RH --> TE

    AI -->|Generate script| AIP
    EA -->|Send report| ES
    VC -->|Push / pull| GP
    TE -->|Launch container| TC
    TC -->|Save results| FS

    TE ==>|Run fails rules| AH
    AH ==>|Ask AI to fix| AI
    AH ==>|Overwrite script| FS
    AH ==>|Rerun| TE

    RH -.-> DB
    TE -.-> DB
    AH -.-> DB
    VC -.-> DB
